            "harmony_adapted": {"type": "boolean", "description": "SCRIPT-stamped (scripts/harmony_adapted.js): true if this package already has an official HarmonyOS PC build in the OpenHarmony PC mirror (an *-ohos_*.whl etc.). Consumed by dim 9 (already-adapted dep ⇒ not a blocker). Do NOT set by hand."},
